Cut and trim video and audio files quickly without re-encoding

LosslessCut is a fast FFmpeg front end for lossless operations on video, audio and subtitle files. Its main use is trimming and cutting large recordings without re-encoding, so there is no quality loss and the work takes seconds.

- Lossless trimming and cutting of video and audio
- No slow re-encoding and no quality loss
- Works with video, audio, subtitle and related media files
